  "Compare data distribution with histograms and estimated density lines. Split the graph with  stratified variables.": "Mbandhingake distribusi data kanthi ramalan lan perkiraan kapadhetan. Graf kasebut dipérang kanthi variabel stratified. Iki uga dibagi kanthi facet.",
  "Plot all data points with time axis or ID axis.": "Plot kabeh nomer data ing sumbu wektu utawa ID sumbu.",
  "Displays a scatter chart matrix. You can create a matrix between up to four target variables.": "Tampilan matriks plot Scatter. Sampeyan bisa nggunakake saka variabel target 2 nganti 7.",
  "This function visualizes “unusual” and analyzes its factors by Principal Component Analysis.": "Miturut analisis komponen utama, visualisasi \"beda\" lan analisis faktor sing ditindakake. Ketik data normal minangka data guru lan nggambarake apa data saiki minangka kahanan sing padha karo data normal (T2 / Q). Yen sampeyan duwe kahanan sing beda, sampeyan bisa mriksa faktor utama ing plot kontribusi.",
  "Stratified Category Filter: Limits data to be displayed to a subset.": "Filter kategori Stratified: Data watesan supaya ditampilake menyang subset. (Kategori: Bagean nomer, stasiun ora, lsp)",
  "Category variables that appears as a label at the head of graphs.": "Variabel kategori (kayata nomer bagean, stasiun ora, lsp) ditampilake minangka label ing sisih ndhuwur plot kanggo golek nilai sing ganti.",
  "Graph Filter: Limits data to be displayed to a subset.": "Filter Grafis: Mbatesi data supaya ditampilake menyang subset.",
  "Set training data to be regarded as normal situation.": "Setel data belajar sing diinterpretasi minangka kahanan normal. Setel bagean data sing ora ngemot data NG. Yen kalebu, sing cedhak karo data NG uga diadili minangka data normal.",
  "Set test data to be judged.": "Nyetel data tes sing bakal diadili.",
  "Item Filter: Limits data (analyse & display) to be displayed to a subset.": "Filter item: Mbatesi data (nganalisa & nampilake) supaya bisa ditampilake kanthi subset.",
  "This is aggregate 2-dimensional plot (dimensional compression by principal components) of multidimensional test data.": "Iki minangka tampilan agregat loro-dimensi (komprèsi dimensi kanthi komponen utama) data verifikasi multipis. Yen data ana ing tengah, bisa diinterpretasi dadi normal.",
  "This is aggregate 2-dimensional plot (dimensional compression by principal components) of multidimensional training data.": "Iki minangka tampilan agregat loro-dimensi (komprèsi dimensi kanthi komponen utama) data belajar multidimensional. Target pusat ditemtokake dening data belajar, saengga umume data sinau kudu target.",
  "This is T2 statistic plot (monitor essential part [principal component] of this data).": "Plot statistik T2, sing ngawasi anomali ing komponen utama data iki. Data belajar direncanakake nganggo warna putih lan ing bagean X Negatif. Plancongan kuning minangka data validasi. Sing luwih dhuwur data validasi dibandhingake karo data putih, kemungkinan bisa nyimpang. Klik titik data kanggo ndeleng plot kontribusi apa unsur sing digawe.",
  "This is Q statistic plot (ｍonitor non-essential parts [residual] of this data).": "Plot statistik Q (ngawasi anomali ing bagean cilik saka data iki, sisa-sisa). Data belajar direncanakake nganggo warna putih lan ing bagean X Negatif. Plancongan kuning minangka data validasi. Sing luwih dhuwur data validasi dibandhingake karo data putih, kemungkinan bisa nyimpang. Klik titik data kanggo ndeleng plot kontribusi apa unsur sing digawe.",
  "This is an ordered barplot of variables that contribute to the state at the point selected in T2 statistic plot.": "Urutan variabel sing menehi kontribusi kanggo kahanan ing titik sing dipilih ing plot statistik T2. Saya suwe, luwih cenderung sababe.",
  "This is an ordered barplot of variables that contribute to the state at the point selected in Q statistic plot.": "Urutan variabel sing menehi kontribusi kanggo kahanan kasebut ing titik sing dipilih ing plot Q Q. Saya suwe, luwih cenderung sababe.",
