  "Visualize long-term data such as annual variations in processes and parameters that can vary depending on days of the week or shifts, etc.": "Visualisasi parameter sing bisa beda-beda karo data sajrone wektu sing suwe, kayata variasi taunan ing proses, dina minggu, shift, lsp.",
