  "Visualize co-occurrence (relationships that focus on how often one phenomenon and another occur at the same time) of faults/alarms.": "Nggambarake kakehan kesalahan, weker, acara lan sapiturute (hubungan fokus ing frekuensi kedadeyan bebarengan siji fenomena siji lan liyane).",
  "Digital Native QC 7 Tools: 7 QC tools compatible with DX developed as tools to support QC activities suitable for the digital native era.": "KosongDigital Native QC 7 Tools : デジタルネイティブ時代にふさわしいQC活動を支えるツールとして開発された、DXに対応したQC7つ道具。",
  "Analysis Platform : That makes it easy to data link, visualize, statistical analysis, and machine learning.": "Analysis Platform: Alat sing gampang kanggo pemetaan data, visualisasi, analisis statistik, lan belajar mesin.",
  "Enter target item of data (quantitative variable like measurement value) to be plotted on the graph. Select the process and item you want to plot on the graph.": "Nemtokake data (umpamane, variabel angka: nilai pangukuran) kanggo plot kasebut. Pilih proses lan barang sing bakal direncanakake ing plot kasebut. Nganti 20 item bisa dipilih.",
  "Enter target item of data (quantitative variable like measurement value) to create data distributions. This data is plotted on the graph.": "Nemtokake data (umpamane, variabel angka: nilai pangukuran) kanggo plot kasebut. Pilih proses lan barang sing bakal direncanakake ing plot kasebut. Nganti 8 item bisa dipilih.",
  "Enter target item of data (quantitative variable like measurement value and category variable like part number) to visualize pattern. This data is plotted on the graph. It can be selected up to ten items.": "Kosong可視化したいパターンを生成するデータ(量的変数：測定値など、カテゴリ変数 : 品番など)の項目です。このデータがグラフにプロットされます。最大18項目選択できます。",
  "Enter target item of data (quantitative variable like measurement value) to visualize the correlation between variables. This data is plotted on the graph. It can be selected up to four items.": "Item data sing nggambarake korélasi ing antarane variabel (variabel kuantitatif: Nilai pangukuran, lan sapiturute). Data iki direncanakake ing grafik. Saka paramèter 2 nganti 7 bisa dipilih.",
  "Enter target item of quantitative variable (like measurement value) in data to visualize the correlation between variables. This data is plotted on the graph.": "Pilih item kanggo nggambarake korélasi ing antarane variabel. Nganti 60 barang sing bisa dipilih.",
  "Enter target item of category variable (like part number) in data to visualize the correlation between variables. This data is plotted on the graph.": "Barang-barang variabel kategori (kayata nomer bagean) kanggo nggambarake korélasi ing antarane variabel.",
